#: src/cli/clean.md:1
msgid "The clean command"
msgstr "清洁命令"

#: src/cli/clean.md:3
msgid ""
"The clean command is used to delete the generated book and any other build "
"artifacts."
msgstr "“clean”命令用于删除生成的书籍文件以及所有其他构建产物。"

#: src/cli/clean.md:10
msgid "Specify a directory"
msgstr "指定一个目录"

#: src/cli/clean.md:12
msgid ""
"The `clean` command can take a directory as an argument to use as the book's "
"root instead of the current working directory."
msgstr ""
"`clean`命令可以接受一个目录作为参数，用作书籍的根目录，而不是当前的工作目录。"

#: src/cli/clean.md:19
msgid "`--dest-dir`"
msgstr "`--dest-dir`"

#: src/cli/clean.md:21
msgid ""
"The `--dest-dir` (`-d`) option allows you to override the book's output "
"directory, which will be deleted by this command. Relative paths are "
"interpreted relative to the book's root directory. If not specified it will "
"default to the value of the `build.build-dir` key in `book.toml`, or to `./"
"book`."
msgstr ""

#: src/cli/clean.md:30
msgid "`path/to/book` could be absolute or relative."
msgstr "可以表示绝对值，也可以表示相对值。"
